, \"Prismlight\", and includes a series of improvements to combat, control guidance, and more.Whether you took part in an earlier test or are setting out on the path to seal demons for the first time, we hope you’ll take this chance to give the game a try during Next Fest!No test ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:15:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1841579228661453","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Available Now! New Playable Character Joins the Fight","summary":"The free demo of Demonbane: Ascension is now available!Unlike our previous playtests, no registration or access request is required this time. Simply head to our Steam store page to download the demo and start playing!New Playable Character \\ Now AvailableThe demo introduces a female playable character — \\.To unlock Ni, you will need to defeat the Chapter 2 boss \\ for the second time.After the battle, a new story dialogue will be triggered. Complete the conversation and return to the village, wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T03:04:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228661453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1839676055887436","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"The Journey Continues. See You Again on August 19!","summary":"Greetings, Banebreakers!As the Blood Moon fades, the second Steam Playtest will officially conclude at July 31, 3:59 PM (UTC).But you won't have to wait long before setting foot in this world again. Demo will launch on August 19 on Steam, no need to request access, everyone will be able to download and play.Next Destination: Western Qi, the desert of deathBefore we look back on this Playtest, we'd like to give you a glimpse of what's ahead, the next chapter currently in development for the full ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T08:04:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887436","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1839041357025558","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Demombane: Ascension Steam Playtest #2 Starts Today!","summary":"Greetings, banebreakers!The Blood Moon befell once again, and a new calamity begins.The second Steam Playtest for Demonbane: Ascension is now live!A heartfelt thank you to everyone who participated in our first playtest, shared feedback, and has continued to support the game. This new playtest focuses on gathering more feedback on the core gameplay experience while introducing two brand-new systems: Wonder Skill and Dao Heart.Playtest ScheduleJuly 22, 8:00 PM (PT) – July 31, 8:59 AM (PT)If you h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T03:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357025558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1838407329258350","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 Begins July 23! Sign Up Now!","summary":"Greetings, Banebreakers!It's been some time since our first playtest came to an end.Since then, we've received a wealth of feedback, along with many questions about when the next test would begin. Thank you to everyone who participated, shared suggestions, and continued to support us.To further improve the game, validate the changes made after the first playtest, and test two major new systems, Wonder Skills and Dao Hearts, we're excited to launch our second Playtest. Your feedback will help sha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T02:59:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329258350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1832065502816722","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"update","title":"Thank You for Joining the Playtest! | Development Update","summary":"Greetings, Banebreakers!Our first Steam Playtest has officially concluded, and we want to extend our deepest gratitude to every player who joined us on this journey.Thank you for dedicating your time and passion to an early development build that is still very much \"in the forge.\" We were thrilled to see players blitz through the first two chapters within hours of gaining access, while many others spent countless hours experimenting with artifact synergies and elemental builds to carve out their","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T03:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502816722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1830797770241215","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest Now Live! Join via the Store Page!","summary":"Banebreakers,The blood moon rises, and a new trial begins. The first public playtest of our cultivation action roguelike Demonbane: Ascension is now live!The playtest runs from April 26 to May 5. If you haven’t signed up yet, head to the Steam store page and click “Request Access” to join: For those who have already registered, access is currently being granted in waves. Selected players will see the Playtest button activated on the store page and receive a notification email from Steam, allowin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-27T03:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770241215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1830797770234795","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Demonbane: Ascension Steam Playtest Begins April 26, Sign Up Now!","summary":"Greetings, Banebreakers!Since the reveal of Demonbane: Ascension, we've received an outpouring of enthusiasm, along with one big question: \"When can we play?\"Today, we're excited to finally share the answer:The Steam Playtest for Demonbane: Ascension will officially begin on April 26, 8:00 PM (Pacific Time)!📝How to Sign Up?No survey required! Starting April 23, simply visit the Steam store page and click “Request Access” to sign up instantly!🎮 How Will I Know If I’m Selected?Starting April 26, p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T03:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770234795","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047520-1823825466504380","game_id":"steam-4047520","kind":"announcement","title":"Cultivation Roguelite Demonbane: Ascension Officially Revealed!","summary":"Greetings, Banebreakers!Today, we are thrilled to reveal our first look at Demonbane: Ascension, a Cultivation Roguelite set in a \"Post-Deification War\" universe! Our Steam store page is now live:https://store.steampowered.com/app/4047520/Every wishlist is the greatest support we could ask for, fuel that drives us to keep refining and enriching this world of gods and demons.After the